<title>FRANCE: Paribas to sell Via Banque.</title>
<headline>Paribas to sell Via Banque.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Paribas Chairman Andre Levy-Lang said on Friday that the group's Via Banque unit, which it controls through Navigation Mixte, would be sold.</p>
<p>&quot;Via Banque will not be part of Paribas in the long term and will therefore have to find another core shareholder,&quot; Levy-Lang said in an interview with weekly Le Journal des Finances.</p>
<p>Via Banque was the biggest gainer on the Paris bourse, up 18.43 percent at 158.7 francs while Paribas hit a year high of 369.0 francs just before closing up 5.04 percent at 368.7.</p>
</text>
